{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-before-tag-name","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-before-tag-name","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream where a tag name is expected.","summary":"In this case the parser treats the beginning of a start tag (i.e., <) or an end tag (i.e., </) as text content.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-before-tag-name","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-before-tag-name","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-cdata","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-cdata","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in a CDATA section.","summary":"The parser treats such CDATA sections as if they are closed immediately before the end of the input stream.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-cdata","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-cdata","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-comment","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-comment","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in a comment.","summary":"The parser treats such comments as if they are closed immediately before the end of the input stream.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-comment","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-comment","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-doctype","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-doctype","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in a DOCTYPE.","summary":"In such a case, if the DOCTYPE is correctly placed as a document preamble, the parser sets the Document to quirks mode.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-doctype","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-doctype","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-processing-instruction","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-processing-instruction","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in a processing instruction (e.g., <? or <?marker name=).","summary":"Such processing instructions are ignored.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-processing-instruction","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-processing-instruction","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-script-html-comment-like-text","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-script-html-comment-like-text","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in text that resembles an HTML comment inside script element content (e.g., <script><!-- foo).","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-script-html-comment-like-text","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-script-html-comment-like-text","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
{"tag":"NEW-html-eof-in-tag","kind":"diagnostic","owner":"html","code":"eof-in-tag","title":"The parser finds the end of the input stream in a start tag or an end tag (e.g., <div id=).","summary":"Such a tag is ignored.","severity":"error","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-tag","licence":"CC-BY-4.0","source":{"url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-error-eof-in-tag","licence":"CC-BY-4.0"}}
